INT. INTERROGATION ROOM - NIGHT

LIEUTENANT ISIDORE MCALLISTER-KANE
Your alibi has a hole in it, Mr. Varga.

BENEDEK VARGA
Everyone's alibi has a hole in it, Lieutenant.

LIEUTENANT ISIDORE MCALLISTER-KANE
Mine doesn't.

BENEDEK VARGA
You haven't been asked.

LIEUTENANT ISIDORE MCALLISTER-KANE
You say you were at the cinema.

BENEDEK VARGA
I was at the cinema.

LIEUTENANT ISIDORE MCALLISTER-KANE
The ticket stub is dated Tuesday.

BENEDEK VARGA
Then I went on Tuesday.

LIEUTENANT ISIDORE MCALLISTER-KANE
The robbery was on Wednesday.

BENEDEK VARGA
Then I was somewhere else on Wednesday.

LIEUTENANT ISIDORE MCALLISTER-KANE
Where?

BENEDEK VARGA
I'd have to think.

LIEUTENANT ISIDORE MCALLISTER-KANE
Think out loud.

BENEDEK VARGA
My mother's. She makes goulash on Wednesdays.

LIEUTENANT ISIDORE MCALLISTER-KANE
Your mother died in March.

BENEDEK VARGA
So she did.

LIEUTENANT ISIDORE MCALLISTER-KANE
Mr. Varga.

BENEDEK VARGA
Lieutenant.
